<h3>MakerForge UI</h3>
<div class="control-group">
    <div class="controls">
        <label class="checkbox">
            <input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: settings.plugins.makerforge.default_ui">
            Use the MakerForge UI as the main page of this OctoPrint
        </label>
        <span class="help-block">
            Turn this off to bring back this classic page as the default. The MakerForge UI stays
            available at <code>/plugin/makerforge/</code> and from the navbar.
            To reach this classic page at any time, add <code>?classic</code> to the address.
        </span>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="control-group">
    <div class="controls">
        <label class="checkbox">
            <input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: settings.plugins.makerforge.classic_skin">
            Give this classic UI the MakerForge dark colours
        </label>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="control-group">
    <div class="controls">
        <span class="help-block">
            Notifications, macros, presets and camera options are set inside the MakerForge UI, under Settings.
        </span>
    </div>
</div>
